       flags every starter JAR (spring-boot-starter-web, starter-data-jpa,
       spring-boot-devtools, etc.) with the same CVE list.
       These JARs contain only auto-configuration glue code; the actual
       runtime libraries (spring-core, spring-web, tomcat-embed) are scanned
       separately and suppressed individually below where appropriate.
       Reviewed 2026-09-18.
       ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════ -->
